Proof: by Algebra, Lemma <a href="/tag/05BU" data-tag="05BU">10.32.7</a> we can lift $\overline{p}_ i$ to a compatible system of projectors $p_{i, n} : (\Lambda /I^ n)^{\oplus t} \to (\Lambda /I^ n)^{\oplus t}$ and then we set $p_ i = \mathop{\mathrm{lim}}\nolimits p_{i, n}$ which works because $\Lambda ^\wedge = \mathop{\mathrm{lim}}\nolimits \Lambda /I^ n$.